        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Fusion E-F6, Contemporary Entry Plate</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Contemporary Entry Plate was designed with high quality craftsmanship to add allure to modern-style homes. Its sophisticated design is meant to add a chic style to any space without being superfluous. The strip-down style in unison with the solid brass material makes this Fusion Hardware keyed entry set the perfect addition to any stylish home. It is available in polished chrome brushed nickel finishes and will fit most standard door borings.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Contemporary Solid Brass Fusion E-F6 Entry Plate:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Solid brass forging and casting.</li>\r\n<li>Bump resistant cylinder.</li> \r\n<li>Solid brass SC1 keyway and 5 pin system with self lubricating solid brass plug & housing.</li>\r\n<li>High security strike.</li> \r\n<li>Reversible latch bolts for inside and outside swing.</li>\r\n<li>Minimal parts for easy installation.</li>\r\n<li>Matching latch, strike and screws for excellent appearance.</li>\r\n<li>Beveled interior screws with single slot for improved visual.</li>\r\n<li>No unsightly or difficult-to-inset set screws are used.</li>\r\n<li>Dual spring assist that eliminates \"knob wobble\".</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Fusion Modern Entry Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Plate Center Door Boring: 5-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Height: 9\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backsets: 2-3/8\" and 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Limited Warranty on workmanship, materials, and operation.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder:</b> The deadbolt is operated by a key on the outside and a thumb turn on the inside while the latch underneath the deadbolt is operated by a turn knob on both the inside and the outside.</li>\r\n<br>\r\n<li><b>Dummy Set:</b> This is a non-functional piece for looks only used to match trim for inactive door. It does not latch and it does not lock.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>The finish for the inside knob or lever you choose will match the outside finish.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Contemporary Front Door Entry Plate, Fusion E-F6",
                "description": "Fusion E-F6 Contemporary Entry Plate - The Contemporary Entry Plate was designed with high quality craftsmanship to add allure to modern-style homes. Its sophisticated design is meant to add a chic style to any space without being superfluous. The strip-down style in unison with the solid brass material makes this Fusion Hardware keyed entry set the perfect addition to any stylish home. It is available in polished chrome brushed nickel finishes and will fit most standard door borings.",
